  "description": "Detective Jung Myeong-seok of Team 1 who does his best in his work.  \nMyeong-seok is ordered to be suspended while protesting to his superior to end the case of sexual assault of a middle school girl he was in charge of.  \nOn the other hand, Sung-hee, who has been threatened and obstructed by Daegwang construction, decides to fight back to protect her pride and value of existence.  \nThe two become embroiled in a dangerous incident and fight against injustice.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=788976), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8114558)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/BOY/teshuqingsao/list?title_no=2111)",
